  "scope": "The application half of resource brokering: a capped purchase against a fresh quote, two separate authorizations, reimbursement of the eligible actual cost exactly once, a platform-absorbed provisioning failure, and a retained commitment until an uncertain settlement is reconciled. No resource wallet is configured, the live buy adapter is disabled, and nothing has been bought from a real provider",
