    "covered": [
      "with no funded resource wallet a purchase is refused and nothing is owed",
      "a quote above the authorized limit, or about to expire, is refused before anything is signed",
      "a purchase cannot exceed the assignment resource allowance, and an undecided charge holds its whole ceiling while a priced one holds only its cost",
      "a paid usable resource is reconciled into one itemized reimbursement, and the ledger still replays",
      "a reconciled cost cannot be reimbursed a second time, in the code or in the database",
      "a purchase the platform could not deliver is absorbed and charged to nobody",
      "an uncertain purchase keeps its commitment through a release and until it is reconciled",
      "an authorization that never settled charges and spends nothing",
      "a settled cost above the authorized limit is held, not charged",
      "a retried purchase returns the one it already started and never reaches the provider twice",
      "a purchase needs its own scope, its own run, and a live attempt",
      "over real HTTP: a builder reads a reconciled purchase at its eligible cost and an unresolved one holding its reservation, the reimbursement is owed to an unconfigured platform wallet, and a run grant cannot reach the purchase route",
