  "limits": [
    "no resource has been bought from a real provider: no wallet is configured, the live buy adapter is not written, and the default adapter refuses everything",
    "the VAL-04 browser-session SKU is no longer in buy's documented resource list, so the recorded SKUs are fixtures and a fresh quote is required before any purchase",
    "reconciliation is an adapter promise: nothing here reads a chain, verifies a receipt, or handles a reorg",
    "an unresolvable purchase holds its reservation indefinitely with no incident queue, notification, or write-off path",
    "a settled cost above the authorized limit is recorded as uncertain and cannot be resolved in the product",
    "operator-owned resources are never recorded and never reimbursable, by having no path rather than a check",
    "the platform cap is global and raised only in the database; there is no per-campaign resource limit, no real balance or allowance check, and no fee on a reimbursement",
    "VAL-04's remaining gate is unchanged: one capped provisioned session, a connected runner, an exported trace, and a real receipt"
